{"ref":"BDB, נָבָל²","hw":"נָבָל²","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָבָל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>on popular etymol. see <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:25\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.25\">1 S 25:25</a> infr.<strong>)</strong>;—a churlish man of Carmel, whose widow David married <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.3\">1 S 25:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:25\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.25\">25</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כִּשְׁמוֹ כֶּן־ה֔וּא נָבָל שְׁמוֹ וּנְבָלָה עִמּוֹ)</span>, v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.26\">26</a> + 10 times 1 S + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.2\">2 S 2:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.3\">3:3</a>. 𝔊 Ναβαλ.","next":"BDB, נְבָלָה","prev":"BDB, נָבָל"}